WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.830
1. Go to Reports. The Register lists every Effective contract.

2
00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:10.154
2. Click Columns and tick what you want to see. Your choice is kept for next time.

3
00:00:10.154 --> 00:00:14.596
3. Click Filters to narrow it down, for example to one business unit.

4
00:00:14.596 --> 00:00:21.266
4. Click Print or save as PDF for a clean printout, or Download Excel for every column.
